  "description": "Hyeon San, a gang member who had been incarcerated for three years, is kidnapped by someone on the very day of his release. Hyeon San is deeply shocked to discover that the perpetrator is none other than Kwon Seong-Gyu, the man he had trusted and followed, and he soon witnesses Kwon’s true colors... \n\nKwon Seong-Gyu, my only salvation. He betrayed me.\n\n(Source: MrBlue, translated)\n\n*Note: Winner of the 16th MrBlue Contest Short Story Category.*",
